[Alexar Pendashteh] Technology, three.

22
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,560
[Alexar Pendashteh] Sociological, seven.

23
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:50,080
[Alexar Pendashteh] And economics, we have three.

24
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,540
[Alexar Pendashteh] Okay.

25
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:54,520
[Alexar Pendashteh] So one, two, three.

26
