00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,440
[Alexar Pendashteh] This is really good.

30
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,700
[Alexar Pendashteh] So votes very quickly, results of the votes.

31
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:14,840
[Alexar Pendashteh] We had sociological and the very top priority and the technology and economics at the tie.

