52
00:04:53,380 --> 00:05:12,520
[Brian Khuu] Jacobi, our expert for this topic, is the founder of MiVote, which is a technological solution to having a voting system on your app, which allows you to vote on what topic or issues should be passed into law in the government.

53
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:17,940
[Brian Khuu] MiVote was a party that ran for government last year.

54
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:33,400
[Brian Khuu] And so, what I will be asking him is to understand more about what has worked, what didn't work and what are the impedence in terms of getting acceptance in society for this kind of solution that he's proposing.

55
